      "name": "Mental Health Managed Care",
      "description": "Mental Health Managed Care, referred to as the Marin Mental Health Plan (MMHP), is responsible for authorizing all mental health services to Medi-Cal beneficiaries from Marin County. A network of individual, agency and county providers provide assessments and referral services.",
