      "name": "Epidemiology",
      "description": "Monitors community health and health trends and informs decision-makers and community members. Program responsibilities include collecting, analyzing, reporting and distributing data; conducting disease surveillance; educating and informing colleagues and community members; providing technical assistance; and conducting and translating research and epidemiology projects.",
