      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Maternal, Child, and Adolescent Health (MCAH)",
      "description": "Develops prevention and early intervention strategies to promote the health of women, infants, children, and adolescents with a focus on low-income populations. MCAH is involved in outreach, advocacy, policy development, assessment, and program planning to increase access to family-centered, culturally-competent systems of health services.",
