      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Tobacco Education",
      "description": "Develops policies and implements strategies to reduce tobacco use; works with all local jurisdictions in Marin to pass comprehensive ordinances to eliminate exposure to second hand smoke and the sale of all flavored tobacco products; and engages in the statewide Healthy Stores Healthy Communities initiative.",
