      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Special Investigations Unit (SIU)",
      "description": "A cooperative effort between the County of Marin and its partner cities and towns to provide a central investigative unit capable of crossing jurisdictional boundaries to assist each other in investigating narcotics-related criminal activity, violent or major crimes, and other habitual criminal matters impacting unincorporated Marin County and the jurisdiction of the SIU. The SIU will take a proactive approach and assist all participating agencies with criminal investigations that require the specialized skills of SIU personnel.",
