      "@id": "https://marincountygov.github.io/marin-data/id/program/board-board-of-supervisors",
      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Board of Supervisors",
      "description": "Serves as the legislative and executive body of Marin County. The Board enacts ordinances, determines policies, adopts budgets, sets salaries, ensures that mandated functions are properly discharged, and supervises County departments. The Board also serves as the governing board of various service areas and special districts.",
