      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Risk Management",
      "description": "Ensures the protection of the property, human, fiscal, and environmental assets of the County through the insurance portfolio, safety and loss control policies, contract reviews and other matters linked to the County’s diverse risk exposures. Oversees the County’s self-insured workers’ compensation program, leaves, reasonable accommodations and the transitional return to work program and provides safety and regulatory compliance training and detention medical bill utilization review.",
