      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Solid Waste and Hazardous Materials",
      "description": "Protects public health and the environment from the effects of improper storage, collection, transportation and disposal of solid waste through inspection, permitting and complaint investigation, and through public education and assistance to the industry.",
