      "@type": "Program",
      "name": "Literacy Services",
      "description": "Supports community members who want to improve their reading, writing and English language skills at the West Marin Literacy Office. The program provides one-on-one tutoring, English as a Second Language (ESL) classes and family literacy programs.",
