      "name": "Communications",
      "description": "Plans, organizes, manages, and oversees department communications, the environmental education program, and events. The program is responsible for increasing public awareness, providing public information, and promoting opportunities for participation and civic engagement by Marin County residents and the Bay Area community of visitors to the County’s parks. General services include public affairs, outreach, environmental education, graphic design, environmental graphics, and writing.",
